### 2.7 日志信息泄露 (M6)

#### 危险模式
```java
// 敏感信息日志
Log.d("Auth", "Password: " + password);
Log.i("Payment", "Card: " + cardNumber);
Log.e("API", "Token: " + accessToken);

// BuildConfig.DEBUG 检查缺失
Log.d(TAG, "Debug info: " + sensitiveData);
